      "text": "PHASE 1: THEORETICAL FOUNDATION (1792–1848)\n  Wollstonecraft: A Vindication of the Rights of Woman (1792)\n  Problem: \"Women are inferior because they lack reason\"\n  Argument: Women lack reason because they are denied education\n  → If education = equal, results = equal\n  → No innate inferiority; only structural disadvantage"
    },
