      "text": "PHASE 2: ORGANIZING + LEGAL DEMANDS (1848–1920)\n  Seneca Falls (1848): Declaration of Sentiments\n  \"All men AND WOMEN are created equal\"\n  Demands: voting rights, property rights, educational access,\n           professional access, divorce reform"
